- | **光源** | 类型 + 方向 + 色温 | `soft overhead fluorescent light, cool white, rim light from window` | ~~`bright room`~~（质量未知） |
- | **镜头** | 焦段 + 构图 + 景深 | `medium shot, centered composition, shallow depth of field` | ~~`nice camera angle`~~（毫无信息） |
